# 🚀 Leaderless Replication (Dynamo Style)

> **Goal:** System mein **koi single Leader nahi hota**. Har node write aur read request handle kar sakta hai. Isse **High Availability**, **Fault Tolerance** aur **No Single Point of Failure** achieve hota hai.

> 💡 **Interview Line:** *Leaderless Replication ka main idea hai "No Leader, Every Node is Equal".*

---

# 📌 Traditional Replication vs Leaderless Replication

## Single Leader Replication

```
               Client

                  |

               WRITE

                  |

             +-----------+
             |  Leader   |
             +-----------+

             /          \

            /            \

     Replica1         Replica2
```

✔️ Sirf Leader write accept karta hai.

Followers sirf copy maintain karte hain.

---

## Leaderless Replication

```
                 Client

          Write to Multiple Nodes

          /        |         \

         /         |          \

    Node A     Node B      Node C

         \         |         /

          \        |        /

             All are Equal
```

👉 Koi Leader nahi.

👉 Har node read bhi kar sakta hai.

👉 Har node write bhi accept kar sakta hai.

---

# 🤔 Why do we need Leaderless Replication?

Single Leader mein problem

```
