# Read Repair vs Anti-Entropy

| Read Repair | Anti-Entropy |
|-------------|--------------|
| Triggered by Read | Runs in Background |
| Repairs only requested data | Repairs entire database gradually |
| Fast | Continuous |
| On-demand | Automatic |

