# 🧠 Memory Trick

```
👑 No Leader

↓

📝 Write Everywhere

↓

📖 Read Anywhere

↓

⚠️ Some Nodes Stale

↓

🩹 Read Repair
→ Fix During Read

🌪️ Anti Entropy
→ Fix in Background

🌳 Merkle Tree
→ Find Differences Fast

🏁 Goal
→ Eventual Consistency
```

> **🔥 Golden Rule:** **Leaderless Replication availability ko priority deta hai.** Kyunki koi leader nahi hota, system failures ko better handle karta hai. Consistency ko maintain karne ke liye **Version Numbers/Version Vectors**, **Read Repair**, **Anti-Entropy**, aur **Merkle Trees** milkar kaam karte hain taaki sab replicas eventually same state par converge kar saken.